### Dependencies

None open (1483 and 1485 closed). Read-only ssh to doudou for the traces; the live runs wait
for post-merge on doudou. The author's call, not blocking: the follow-up for `/update-publist`
(item 8) and the carnet line (item 7). Contention: none; only new files, three one-line card
edits and the regenerated catalog.

### Antipattern scan

- Tautology: a trace that only restates archive.md's checklist proves nothing. Guard: the table
  is keyed on the carnet's own step titles and file evidence read over ssh, and trace B must be
  able to fail (it fails if a Jéco artifact is missing or the walk finds a step with no
  evidence). Also, trace A walks a post already archived, so it tests coverage of the
  procedure, not the live path; said plainly in the log.
- Copying recipes into the skill (WordPress REST, TEI fields, HAL structure id): they drift
  from the carnet; the skill points, it does not carry.
- YAGNI, left out: helper script, channel registry, shared trunk file, op-ed TEI template,
  an `/update-publist` row, a per-stage argument for the newspaper variants, a census budget
  raise.
- Count-gaming: the trims are real text deletions with no behaviour tied to them (grep
  checked); re-measure the census after the edit, do not trust the arithmetic.

### Done when

1. Carnet AGENTS.md holds what is local, the skill holds only stages, routing, gates: text
   delivered (the line in the PR body and ticket log), author lands it in the carnet.
2. Router and three references exist, catalog updated, hygiene tests pass: evidence = outputs
   of `make skills-catalog`, `make check-skills-drift`, the census test, the description and
   frontmatter tests, `make check-agnostic-skills`.
3. Six sections in each of draft, publish, archive: evidence = `grep -c` of the six headings
   (Registers, Provenance, Filesystem, Outward gates, Delegates, Author-only) per file, plus
   Done when.
4. Dry run for the 2026-11-06 post reproduces steps 1-7 with nothing left to discover:
   traced against the real carnet text (table A), live run post-merge on doudou.
5. Jéco tribune dry run lands on "nothing to do except the roadmap check": traced against the
   real mission folder (trace B), live run post-merge on doudou.
6. Carnet AGENTS.md points at `/post` in one line, recipes unchanged: text delivered, author
   lands it in the carnet.
7. `make check` passes: its full output last line quoted.
